---
layout: base.njk
description: "Fairport High School all-time top 10 indoor track and field performances for every event, boys and girls."
title: All-time top 10
permalink: /top-10/
---
<div class="wrap">
  <h1 class="page-title">All-time top 10</h1>
  <p class="page-lede">Fairport's ten best indoor marks in every event. Equal marks share a place. <span class="current-key">Highlighted rows</span> were set in the {{ rankings.currentYear | seasonLabel }} season.</p>

  <div class="list-tools">
    <nav class="event-jump" aria-label="Jump to event">
      {% for event in rankings.events %}<a href="#{{ event.id }}">{{ event.label }}</a>{% endfor %}
    </nav>
    <div class="gender-toggle" role="group" aria-label="Show lists for" hidden>
      <button type="button" data-show="both" aria-pressed="true">Girls and boys</button>
      <button type="button" data-show="girls" aria-pressed="false">Girls</button>
      <button type="button" data-show="boys" aria-pressed="false">Boys</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  {% for event in rankings.events %}
  <section class="event" id="{{ event.id }}" aria-labelledby="h-{{ event.id }}">
    <h2 class="event__title" id="h-{{ event.id }}">{{ event.label }}</h2>
    <div class="event__lists">
      {% for gender in ["girls", "boys"] %}
        {% set list = event.lists[gender] %}
        {% if list %}
        <div class="toplist" data-gender="{{ gender }}">
          <h3 class="toplist__title">{{ gender | capitalize }}{% if event.girls != event.boys %} {{ list.code }}{% endif %}</h3>
          {% if list.top.length %}
          <table class="toplist__table">
            <thead class="visually-hidden"><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Athlete</th><th scope="col">Mark</th><th scope="col">Year</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
            {% for entry in list.top %}
              <tr{% if entry.year == rankings.currentYear | string %} class="is-current"{% endif %}>
                <td class="toplist__rank">{{ "T" if entry.tied }}{{ entry.rank }}</td>
                <td class="toplist__who">{% include "entry.njk" %}{% if entry.notes %}<span class="toplist__note">{{ entry.notes }}</span>{% endif %}</td>
                <td class="toplist__mark">{{ entry.mark }}</td>
                <td class="toplist__year">{{ entry.year }}</td>
              </tr>
            {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
          {% else %}
            <p class="empty">No marks on file yet.</p>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
